title: Rename opens a field in the file's row with the name in it (pictures only: no step can type into that field), and nothing is renamed by leaving
folders: edit-odd
limit: 40
expect-file: edit-odd/b.txt :: (?-i)\Afirst of b\nsecond of b\n\z
absent-file: edit-odd/NEWNAME
absent-file: edit-odd/NEWNAME.txt

wait 3000
left files
rename b.txt
wait 700
mark field
wait 500
type NEWNAME
key enter
wait 500
mark after-typing
wait 500
quit
